BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_798136ae-86e2-3b0f-9db5-e9bc1ef165b3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
